{"id": "d001-006", "text": "Coffee with Dorota. She's been knitting a blanket for her niece for about six months, nearly done. Her niece Ioana is due in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "niece", "occ": 2, "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d001-007", "text": "Luca said his nan died last week. Funeral's sometime after Christmas because the family are all flying in from Italy. He's really struggling. They were close, she basically raised him while his parents worked. He's taking some time off work and might go over to Turin for a bit in the new year to help sort the house. Keep an eye on him, maybe take him for a pint at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "close", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "time off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go over to Turin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Keep an eye on him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "d001-009", "text": "so Amir was telling me about this board game cafe he goes to on Wednesdays, he's really into Twilight Imperium, games last like eight hours. He wants to get a group together sometime next month, I said I'm in. Apparently his flatmate Zhang paints all the miniatures and they've got a whole shelf of them. Bring snacks, it's a long one. He also mentioned he's been designing his own game on the side, wants people to playtest it after Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "board game cafe", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Twilight Imperium", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "get a group together", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "paints all the miniatures", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring snacks", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "designing his own game", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playtest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d001-012", "text": "Gareth - redundancy confirmed, last day end of Nov. Thinking of retraining as an electrician in the new year, course starts in January if he gets a place. Wife Nora is supportive but worried about money, they've just remortgaged. He was trying to be upbeat but you could tell he's gutted, he's been there 22 years. Ask him how the course application goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Thinking of retraining as an electrician", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "supportive", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about money", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "been there 22 years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how the course application goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "course application", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "d001-018", "text": "Voice memo. Okay so talked to Katarzyna for ages on the phone tonight. Her grandad, the one in Krakow, died on Monday, really suddenly. She's flying out Wednesday morning and the funeral is the day after she lands, so Thursday. She'll be back sometime the week after. Her boss has been decent about it. Remind me to message her Thursday evening, and maybe drop off some food when she's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after she lands", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d8", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "d001-020", "text": "Aidan's breakup with Ruby was a while ago now but he still seems low. Need to invite him out more. He's into climbing, maybe the bouldering place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him out more", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d001-022", "text": "Reza's grandma turns 90 next month, big family party the Saturday after. He wants to make her a photo book.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 90", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big family party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to make her a photo book", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "d001-030", "text": "Dorota's sister Krisztina had her baby! Little boy, born on Sunday morning. Dorota flies over to see them a week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d001-031", "text": "Note from walk w Luca: he's got really into fly fishing, ties his own flies, goes up to the Wye most weekends. His birthday's 14 Feb, maybe a fly box.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ties his own flies", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wye", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most weekends"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 Feb", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fly box", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "d001-032", "text": "Amir mentioned his mum's been in hospital since the weekend, scan on Wednesday afternoon. Check in with him Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the weekend"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-033", "text": "Joe and his wife are doing up the spare room, their second baby is due in June. He's nervous about it all.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "d001-034", "text": "Owen's cat Pickles went missing on Monday, they've put posters up everywhere. Ask him tomorrow if she's turned up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-036", "text": "long chat with Alana after book club. she's reading everything by Elena Ferrante, wants to do Italian lessons in the spring so she can read them in the original. thinks she might go to Naples in the summer. her girlfriend Hana isn't keen on the trip. no idea when book club is next, sometime soon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Elena Ferrante", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Italian lessons", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go to Naples", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't keen on the trip", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "book club", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime soon", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "d001-039", "text": "Henrik's dad is retiring at the end of the year after 40 years teaching. Party in January sometime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "40 years teaching", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January sometime", "anchor": "e2"}]}
